    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a saucepan over medium-low heat. Stir in brown sugar, corn syrup, cocoa powder, and vanilla; cook until mixture begins to bubble, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
